  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: (open design slot)
    AbilityDescription: 'Charge mapping not yet designed for the Flail (prototype). The hull''s
      two trigger abilities - WINCH on the right trigger (hold to let chain out, release to
      reel in and crack) and PLANT on the left (hold to plant the ball and swing round it) -
      are live but deliberately unassigned to any element pending design approval; see
      R_VesselActions/FLAIL.md for the candidate dials (ball mass, chain reach, spin-up rate,
      smash speed).'
